<div class="page-header"><h1>Kitchen Cabinets in Idaho</h1><p>From the fast-growing Treasure Valley to the lakefront homes of North Idaho and the resort kitchens of Sun Valley, Idaho homeowners and designers can spec the full Pinnacle Sales lineup — Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets — through independent local showrooms.</p></div>
<div class="content-narrow section">
<Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

<p>Idaho is one of the country's fastest-growing kitchen markets, driven by new construction across Boise, Meridian, and Eagle, alongside a high-end remodel market in Coeur d'Alene and Ketchum. This guide covers the brands available and where to see them.</p>
<h2 id="find-a-kitchen-cabinet-showroom-near-you">Find a Kitchen Cabinet Showroom Near You</h2>
<p>Pinnacle Sales brands are sold through independent local showrooms across Idaho. Tell us your project and where you're located, and we'll connect you with the nearest authorized dealer.</p>
<p><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact">Find a Local Dealer</a></p>
<h2 id="premium-cabinetry-brands-available-in-idaho">Premium Cabinetry Brands Available in Idaho</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — Custom paint and broad wood species for Idaho's mix of transitional and mountain-modern kitchens.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access construction for contemporary builds.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Value semi-custom built for the Treasure Valley's heavy new-construction volume.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Handleless European kitchens for high-end lake and resort homes.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/vistora-closets">Vistora Closets</a></strong> — Made-to-order closets and storage.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="idaho-kitchen-design-trends">Idaho Kitchen Design Trends</h2>
<p>Idaho kitchens blend transitional warmth with mountain-modern character. Treasure Valley new construction favors painted perimeters with stained islands, shaker and modern-shaker doors, and durable, value-minded semi-custom. In North Idaho's lakefront communities and the Sun Valley resort market, the look turns to mountain-modern luxury — knotty alder, rift oak, slatted wood, and increasingly clean <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> and handleless fronts.</p>
